Package: MACanalyzeR
Type: Package
Title: Tool for Single-Cell Analysis of Macrophages
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andrea", "Ninni", email = "andrea.ninni@uniroma2.it", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Fabio", "Zaccaria", role = "ctb"),
    person("Luca", "Verteramo", role = "ctb"),
    person("Francesca", "Sciarretta", role = "ctb"))
Description: Characterization of monocytes and macrophages in single-cell RNA-seq data:
    identification of foam-like macrophages (FoamSpotteR), polarization analysis (MacPolarizeR),
    pathway scoring at group and single-cell level (PathAnalyzeR) and mitochondrial profiling
    (MitoScanneR), starting from a Seurat object.
